<title>POLAND: Zasada turns to PLN 5.6 mln profit in Q2.</title>
<headline>Zasada turns to PLN 5.6 mln profit in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zasada preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 6.83 vs     2.82</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  11.08 vs     4.28 loss</p>
<p>    net profit				 5.57 vs     5.20 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Sobieslaw Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				232.41 vs    80.50</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 226.62 vs    64.31</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 5.51 vs     0.93</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    24.46 vs     5.90</p>
<p>    financial costs			 20.21 vs    13.00</p>
<p>    investment				 2.82 vs     5.89</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			11.56 vs     7.62</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  14.17 vs     2.43 loss</p>
<p>    net profit				 6.12 vs     4.08 loss</p>
<p>    net sales				336.64 vs   181.21</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 349.25 vs   160.21</p>
